Corrected earlier WIP: retained transport error details and relay bind-holder reporting, which are valid diagnostics. Replaced the false mp_notify_relay.py port-conflict fixture/example with an unrelated stale_listener.py and updated its assertions. Updated the pre-existing exact online list assertion for the deliberately additive offline_detail:null field; this preserves its contract rather than removing a useful diagnostic. The title catalog already has the requested one-line title. The changelog now describes the behavior fixes in one sentence.

